a so you  could afford to go do this thing that  wasn't gonna make you a lot of money  anyway why I don't have an answer for  what drove me to do it I just had this  deep burning gut desire of like it's  gonna work out just keep going just keep  going Swayze's gut was right all that  sacrifice paid off when she got that  first call from the UFC  can you explain what it's like during a  fight oh it's really actually  indescribable I'm excited I'm nervous I  get most comfortable when I finally sit  down and I get my sheet and it shows who  I'm gonna rap and then I go in there and  when I meet the fighter I shake  everyone's hand and that like totally  brings me down the bigger stage for  Swayze is still not enough to pay the  bills so she works at her local post  office six days a week comp and vacation  time allows her to take off for UFC  matches did all your fellow employees  know what you do in your spare time they  do what do they think they love it on  the outside they're just like oh my gosh  it's so dangerous like are you okay are  you safe and I'm like absolutely so  they're super proud of me and they love  hearing like what am i next show how did  it go so they're super supportive and  that support is something Swayze passes  along simply by being that lone female  face what message do you have to some  little girl who sees you out there that  says well there's only one I don't know  if I could do that well now I know after  being the first that there are many more  women following my path already and I  just hope that any little girl that sees  that too shows that hey you can achieve  your dreams whether it's your first or  the 15th or the 30th you do what you  want to do and love every second of it  Swayze's next UFC event is on November  17th in Argentina and there were some  men along  wake up men that sort of took her under  the wing and taught her tricks of the  trade that you had to know to do it but  that was just determination that got her  there you know she loves it six days a  week and still the smile on her face  from ear to ear a job that doesn't pay  man or woman you want a definition for  passions he Swayze but there it is

